---
title: Pie & Donut Charts
theme: minimal
---

# Market Share

Standard pie chart:

```chart type=pie label=product value=share title="Market share"
product, share
Alpha, 45
Beta, 30
Gamma, 15
Delta, 10
```

Donut variant (add `donut`):

```chart type=pie label=product value=share donut title="Market share (donut)"
product, share
Alpha, 45
Beta, 30
Gamma, 15
Delta, 10
```
